  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a harmonicist may change the subject of one of his ongoing scores to another creature in range as a swift action. Intro and outro effects are not triggered.</p>\n<p>As only harmonicist scores have a subject, only harmonicist scores can be affected by this ability. (Other composing classes may have individual melodies that have specific subjects, but only harmonicists target outright with the entire score.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/harmonicist#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
